comment.narrative:
1.	Rules and procedures for NCCC prepared
2.	1 multi-hazard comprehensive risk and vulnerability assessments produced
3.	Inventory of existing CCA projects prepared
4.	At least 1 training organized with RHMZ
5.	At least 2 guidance trainings on NAP platform organized;
6.	NAP platform fully operational
7.	At least 5 gender sensitive methodologies developed; 
8.	Draft Bylaw in Accordance with Article 15 prepared; 
9.	SEA prepared; 
10.	Impact assessment conducted; 
11.	NAP prepared, No. of sectorial adaptation plans developed
12.	Online NAP training materials available
13.	Developed higher education curricula on CCA integration
